 "label": "PROVISIONAL_ASR_NOT_LISTENING",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.48,
   "text": "If someone's DNA suddenly vanished, how long would that person last?",
   "avg_logprob": -0.157,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.001
  },
  {
   "start": 4.26,
   "end": 7.92,
   "text": "Nobody has ever lost all their DNA, so we can't say for sure what the precise sequence",
   "avg_logprob": -0.157,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.001
  },
  {
   "start": 7.92,
   "end": 9.36,
   "text": "of medical consequences would be.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.157,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.001
  },
  {
   "start": 9.72,
   "end": 13.68,
   "text": "But mushroom poisoning, chemotherapy, and radiation poisoning can give us a rough idea.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.157,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.001
  },
  {
   "start": 14.46,
   "end": 17.9,
   "text": "Amanita bisporigia is a species of mushroom found in eastern North America known by the",
   "avg_logprob": -0.157,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.001
  },
  {
   "start": 17.9,
   "end": 19.26,
   "text": "common name Destroying Angel.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.157,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.001
  },
  {
   "start": 19.66,
   "end": 22.46,
   "text": "If you're like me, you were told to never eat mushrooms you found in the woods.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.157,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.001
  },
  {
   "start": 23.1,
   "end": 24.44,
   "text": "Amanita is the reason why.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.157,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.001
  },
  {
   "start": 25.0,
   "end": 27.68,
   "text": "If you eat a Destroying Angel, for the rest of the day you'll feel fine.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.157,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.001
  },
  {
   "start": 27.68,
   "end": 31.78,
   "text": "Later that night, or the next morning, you'll suffer from vomiting, abdominal pain, and",
   "avg_logprob": -0.138,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.007
  },
  {
   "start": 31.78,
   "end": 32.5,
   "text": "severe diarrhea.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.138,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.007
  },
  {
   "start": 33.0,
   "end": 36.46,
   "text": "Then you'll start to feel better, at which point the damage is probably irreversible.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.138,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.007
  },
  {
   "start": 37.2,
   "end": 41.12,
   "text": "Amanita mushrooms contain amitoxin, which interferes with an enzyme used to read DNA,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.138,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.007
  },
  {
   "start": 41.28,
   "end": 44.8,
   "text": "interrupting the process by which cells follow DNA's instructions and causing irreversible",
   "avg_logprob": -0.138,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.007
  },
  {
   "start": 44.8,
   "end": 46.6,
   "text": "damage to whatever cells it collects in.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.138,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.007
  },
  {
   "start": 47.08,
   "end": 49.62,
   "text": "Since most of your body is made of cells, this is bad for you.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.138,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.007
  },
  {
   "start": 50.1,
   "end": 53.62,
   "text": "Death is generally caused by liver or kidney failure, since those are the first sensitive",
   "avg_logprob": -0.138,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.007
  },
  {
   "start": 53.62,
   "end": 55.16,
   "text": "organs in which the toxin accumulates.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.138,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.007
  },
  {
   "start": 55.16,
   "end": 59.62,
   "text": "Sometimes, intensive care and a liver transplant can be enough to save a patient, but often not.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.017
  },
  {
   "start": 60.16,
   "end": 63.94,
   "text": "The really frightening thing about Amanita poisoning is the walking ghost phase, the",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.017
  },
  {
   "start": 63.94,
   "end": 67.58,
   "text": "period where you seem to be getting better, but your cells continue to accumulate irreversible",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.017
  },
  {
   "start": 67.58,
   "end": 68.58,
   "text": "and lethal damage.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.017
  },
  {
   "start": 69.08,
   "end": 72.88,
   "text": "This pattern is typical of DNA damage, and we'd likely see something like it in someone",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.017
  },
  {
   "start": 72.88,
   "end": 73.82,
   "text": "who lost their DNA.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.017
  },
  {
   "start": 74.34,
   "end": 78.58,
   "text": "The picture is even more vividly illustrated by two other examples of DNA damage, chemotherapy",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.017
  },
  {
   "start": 78.58,
   "end": 79.58,
   "text": "and radiation.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.017
  },
  {
   "start": 80.58,
   "end": 84.4,
   "text": "Doxorubicin, one of the most common in potent chemotherapy drugs, interrupts cell division",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.017
  },
  {
   "start": 84.4,
   "end": 87.02,
   "text": "by linking and tangling random sections of DNA together.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.117,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 87.44,
   "end": 91.22,
   "text": "The reason Doxorubicin selectively kills cancer cells is that cancer cells are dividing all",
   "avg_logprob": -0.117,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 91.22,
   "end": 93.56,
   "text": "the time, whereas most normal cells only divide occasionally.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.117,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 94.08,
   "end": 98.22,
   "text": "Some human cells do divide nearly constantly, like those found in hair follicles, bone marrow",
   "avg_logprob": -0.117,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 98.22,
   "end": 100.76,
   "text": "which produces blood, including white blood cells, and stomach lining.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.117,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 101.22,
   "end": 104.6,
   "text": "Chemotherapy messes with the DNA of such constantly dividing cells and hampers cell",
   "avg_logprob": -0.117,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 104.6,
   "end": 108.58,
   "text": "division, causing hair loss, vulnerability to infections, and, most immediately, nausea,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.117,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 108.7,
   "end": 109.56,
   "text": "vomiting, and diarrhea.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.117,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 110.18,
   "end": 113.96,
   "text": "Radiation poisoning also has a walking ghost phase, where the body is still working, but",
   "avg_logprob": -0.117,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 113.96,
   "end": 116.82,
   "text": "no new proteins can be synthesized and the immune system is collapsing.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.106,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 117.54,
   "end": 121.82,
   "text": "In cases of severe radiation poisoning, immune system collapses off in the primary cause of",
   "avg_logprob": -0.106,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 121.82,
   "end": 122.04,
   "text": "death.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.106,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 122.32,
   "end": 125.62,
   "text": "Without a supply of white blood cells, the body can't fight off infections, and ordinary",
   "avg_logprob": -0.106,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 125.62,
   "end": 127.26,
   "text": "bacteria in the body run wild.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.106,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 127.78,
   "end": 131.52,
   "text": "In short, losing your DNA would most likely result in abdominal pain, nausea, dizziness,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.106,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 131.72,
   "end": 135.18,
   "text": "rapid immune system collapse, and death within days or hours from either rapid systemic",
   "avg_logprob": -0.106,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 135.18,
   "end": 137.2,
   "text": "infection or system-wide organ failure.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.106,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 137.6,
   "end": 139.58,
   "text": "On the other hand, there would be at least one silver lining.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.106,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 139.58,
   "end": 144.26,
   "text": "If we ever end up in a dystopian future where an Orwellian, Gattaca-style police state collects",
   "avg_logprob": -0.196,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.284
  },
  {
   "start": 144.26,
   "end": 147.94,
   "text": "our genetic information and uses it to track and control us, you'd be invisible.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.196,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.284
  }
 ],
